  "text": "### 5. Reputational Risk  \n**Appetite:** Low  \n**Tolerance:**\n- **Major Complaints:** <2 per 1,000 accounts\n- **Regulatory Complaints:** <1 per 1,000 accounts\n- **Media Incidents:** Zero negative incidents (aspirational)\n- **Customer Trust:** NPS >70 (Net Promoter Score)  \n**Rationale:**\nFirstUK Bank's brand depends on customer trust and operational reliability. Manages reputation actively through customer service, compliance, and transparency.  \n**Controls:**\n- Customer service excellence (NPS tracking)\n- Fast complaint resolution\n- Transparent communication with regulators\n- Crisis communication planning\n- Social media monitoring  \n---",
